# benchmark_name|runner_script|description
# DaCapo
tomcat|profiling/runscript/run_tomcat.sh|DaCapo tomcat benchmark (Apache implementation of Jakarta Servlet, Jakarta EL, and WebSocket)
# Renaissance
finagle-http|profiling/runscript/run_finagle_http.sh|Renaissance finagle-http benchmark (Twitter Finagle HTTP server/client workload)
finagle-chirper|profiling/runscript/run_finagle_chirper.sh|Renaissance finagle-chirper benchmark (Twitter microblogging workload)
# Rocket Chip + Verilator
verilator-qsort|profiling/runscript/run_verilator_qsort.sh|Chipyard large multi-core BOOM Verilator simulation running qsort.riscv
